            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system comprises a capsule, a drum of the capsule comprising a wall defining a chamber, and an additional drum of the capsule. The drum is disposed within the additional drum. The system comprises a drive system configured to drive rotation of the drum about a central axis of the drum and relative to the additional drum. The drive system is configured to drive forward or rearward movement of the capsule along a track. The central axis of the drum is parallel to a direction of travel of the forward and rearward movement of the capsule along the track.</p>
            </abstract>
